  "description": [
    {
      "value": "<p>A rocky moon on a steeply inclined retrograde orbit, whose oxygen isotope ratios match nothing else in the system and do match a class of body common around the older stars of the Seventh Shell. It was captured, and not recently: the orbit has had time to circularise part of the way. It is airless, cratered and, for a body of no economic interest whatever, generously funded.</p>",
      "inLanguage": [{ "id": ["core.peerdb.org", "LANGUAGE", "en-GB"] }]
    }
